msgctxt "EdCommon.CameraBookmarks"
msgid "Camera bookmarks: move the view to a saved camera position (Ctrl+1~9)"
msgstr "카메라 북마크: 저장한 카메라 위치로 뷰를 옮깁니다 (Ctrl+1~9)"

