#: Source/Editor/Common/GUI/EditorMenuBar.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.CompileGame"
msgid "Live Coding: compile the SWGame module now and hot-reload it (Ctrl+Alt+F11)"
msgstr "라이브 코딩: SWGame 모듈을 즉시 컴파일하고 핫리로드합니다 (Ctrl+Alt+F11)"

