#: Source/Editor/Common/Widgets/EditorNetModeCombo.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetMode"
msgid "Net Mode: Standalone plays inside the editor; the other modes launch a separate server and clients (Window > Multiplayer)."
msgstr "Net Mode — Standalone 은 에디터 안에서 재생하고, 나머지는 서버와 클라이언트를 따로 띄운다 (Window > Multiplayer)"

